        "The same 256 inputs are reused; reserved audit cases and probe cohorts can differ. These are development results, not independent replications or a confirmed superiority finding.",
        "<b>Our proposed method has NOT been evaluated on the full 6,240-case MPBench dataset.</b>",
        "<i>Source:</i> verified frozen comparison.json, D00-D07 (1 November 2026). Only methods with saved pilot outcomes are shown; - denotes unavailable results."
